{"3701190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mycofall", "steam_appid": 3701190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Play Mycofall on Steam Deck</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/8590a746312041e5cdfa021ba5163da5.avif?t=1785181488\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/2fe0f087e33848740e71ac7024500787.avif?t=1785181488\" width=650 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/34591536aaa20dbc5a7bf4484bdc0e6e.poster.avif?t=1785181488\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/34591536aaa20dbc5a7bf4484bdc0e6e.webm?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/34591536aaa20dbc5a7bf4484bdc0e6e.mp4?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mycofall is a bullet heaven title that offers <strong>fast gameplay</strong>, <strong>deep playstyle and build optimization</strong> and a <strong>unique mushroom core loop</strong> that blends collecting resources and killing creeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No aiming is required, you focus on <strong>moving</strong>, <strong>dashing</strong>, <strong>dodging</strong>, <strong>making build decisions</strong> and <strong>collecting your primary resource: mycelium</strong>. It spawns as you kill insects, the faster you, the more mushrooms spawn, got the idea? Perfect for the min-maxing kind of players, huh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of twisted insects in our fantasy bullet-hell survivors-like setting. <strong>Play solo or team up online</strong>, share progress, and combine powers to stand against the swarm together. If you are looking for a game like <i>Deep Rock Galactic: Survivor</i> or <i>The Spell Brigade</i> our game is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/efbe4ac58706505177d4cf9b24d9aa7b.avif?t=1785181488\" width=650 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/d08f8ca1ae19556e8dc045e37d11978d.poster.avif?t=1785181488\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/d08f8ca1ae19556e8dc045e37d11978d.webm?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/d08f8ca1ae19556e8dc045e37d11978d.mp4?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>unique mushroom core loop</strong> blends killing creeps and collecting your main resource mycelium that spawns as you kill enemies. If you want to master Mycofall's core mechanic you'll need to <strong>build your own playstyle</strong> that allows you <strong>perfect pathing</strong> to collect the mycelium while killing enough creeps to <strong>trigger the mushroom respawn-o-meter.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you struggle to climb up the leaderboard it's most likely because you screw up paying attention to this system. No worries it takes some time and practice to <strong>improve your mycelium-per-minute-rate</strong> (mpm - yeah, that's a real metric).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/201a210cd19bc88aedbc9e49c2296147.avif?t=1785181488\" width=650 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/7964d1cabb7b99867e112ce438556fb7.poster.avif?t=1785181488\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/7964d1cabb7b99867e112ce438556fb7.webm?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/7964d1cabb7b99867e112ce438556fb7.mp4?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mycofall your character holds up to 6 skills — but you'll spend most of your time leveling, <strong>evolving and morphing</strong> them rather than adding new ones. Want a crit-build? Done. Lifesteal setup? Yup. The &quot;Fast Boi&quot;-Build? Sure. <strong>You define how each skill behaves</strong>, what perks it gets, and what enemies it targets. And then <strong>combine it all for broken synergies</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>character perk-sets</strong> that shift your entire playstyle, plus <strong>15+ attributes</strong> like speed, mycelium-bonus-rate, armor, hp-regen, dash-range and more. <strong>The build space is deep</strong>. Craft your own, and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/b2f302de6e05def5395dd9ddcf4bbe58.avif?t=1785181488\" width=650 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/c2ed6564a63c4d3764d04eb468069182.poster.avif?t=1785181488\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/c2ed6564a63c4d3764d04eb468069182.webm?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/c2ed6564a63c4d3764d04eb468069182.mp4?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing kills replayability faster than missing meta progression. That's why Mycofall offers a <strong>vast library of permanent unlocks</strong> — giving you even more options and flexibility to define your own build. Unlock characters, skills and perks using one currency: The purple <strong>Meta Mushrooms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/1f4ce010ce53290566e86dd137ad11b6.avif?t=1785181488\" width=650 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/d2ae06be92607e35a3148e15021e1500.poster.avif?t=1785181488\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/d2ae06be92607e35a3148e15021e1500.webm?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/d2ae06be92607e35a3148e15021e1500.mp4?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why spend hundreds of hours in a bullet heaven? Either you're grinding an audiobook/evergreen sitcom, or you're <strong>chasing the top 100</strong>. Maybe even top 10. Mycofall's global leaderboards are split by difficulty and player count, because comparing a 4-player difficulty 3 co-op run to a soloplayer difficulty 1 session isn't fair. <strong>Clean</strong>, <strong>transparent</strong>, <strong>competitive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And now dive into the woods! Download the Demo, hit the wishlist button and munch some <span class=\"bb_strike\">shrooms</span> <span class=\"bb_strike\">bugs</span> creeps.</strong> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/2fe0f087e33848740e71ac7024500787.avif?t=1785181488\" width=650 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/34591536aaa20dbc5a7bf4484bdc0e6e.poster.avif?t=1785181488\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/34591536aaa20dbc5a7bf4484bdc0e6e.webm?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/34591536aaa20dbc5a7bf4484bdc0e6e.mp4?t=1785181488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mycofall is a bullet heaven title that offers <strong>fast gamepla